  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/981858?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;color=#F16436&amp;link=https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/extra-recipe\" alt=\"Curse Forge\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/7AXsRqp1?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;color=#00AF5C&amp;link=https://modrinth.com/datapack/extra-recipe\" alt=\"Modrinth 下載數\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/last-commit/CTNStudio/Extra-Recipe?display_timestamp=committer&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;color=#181717&amp;link=https://github.com/CTNStudio/Extra-Recipe\" alt=\"GitHub 最後提交\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1152184082130813009?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;color=#5865F2&amp;cacheSeconds=https://discord.gg/2Eb53FxvYf&amp;link=https://discord.gg/ZUzg99PDsw\" alt=\"Discord 伺服器\"></p><p>還在為找不到附魔金蘋果而煩惱嗎？還在為鐵砧磨損而無能為力嗎？</p><p>額外配方來解決您的困擾！這個專案具體新增或修改的內容：鑽石/黃金/鐵製馬鎧配方、命名牌配方、不死圖騰配方、附魔金蘋果配方（以及更多！）...</p><p>為什麼要下載這個專案：因為它實在太棒了。:)</p><p>下載前須知的其他重要資訊：您可以向我詢問任何相關問題。</p><p>玩得開心！</p><h2>版本相容性</h2><p>關於檔案後綴：後綴代表支援的版本。具體支援版本請見下表。</p><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>版本後綴</th>\n<th>Minecraft 版本</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>-4</td>\n<td>1.13 – 1.14.4</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>-5</td>\n<td>1.15 – 1.16.1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>-6</td>\n<td>1.16.2 – 1.16.5</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>-7</td>\n<td>1.17 – 1.17.1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>-8</td>\n<td>1.18 – 1.18.1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>-9</td>\n<td>1.18.2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>-10</td>\n<td>1.19 – 1.19.3</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>-12</td>\n<td>1.19.4</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>-15</td>\n<td>1.20 – 1.20.1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>-18</td>\n<td>1.20.2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>-26</td>\n<td>1.20.3 – 1.20.4</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>-41</td>\n<td>1.20.5 – 1.20.6</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>-48</td>\n<td>1.21 – 1.21.1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>-57</td>\n<td>1.21.2 – 1.21.3</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>-61</td>\n<td>1.21.4</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>-71</td>\n<td>1.21.5</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>-80</td>\